# Way of the Paradox: "Whenever you activate a loyalty ability, you gain 1 life. You may play an additional land this turn." On turn 1
# (Black Lotus pays) it empowers a Jace token to 5; Mishra's Bauble's activation (a nonmana ability that is not a loyalty ability)
# gains no life (20); with a land already played a second is refused, then the token's -1 makes the
# trigger: 1 life (21) and exactly one more land (the second is played, a third refused). On turn 2 Bot2's own planeswalker activation
# does nothing for Bot1 (still 21; "you"). On turn 3 the permission is gone: one land, the second refused; then two activations
# (the token's, Ajani Resolute's) give 1 life each plus Ajani's own 1 (24) and two more lands, of which one is played ("may").

